- canary deployment
- blue/green deployment

---

# Backup Standards

Deploy Velero.

Store backups in:

Azure Blob Storage

Generate:

daily
weekly
monthly

backup schedules.

---

# Disaster Recovery

Use:

Primary Region
Secondary Region

Implement:

- ACR replication
- Backup replication
- Storage GRS
- Recovery procedures

Generate DR runbooks.

---

# FinOps Standards

Always optimize cost.

Implement:

- OpenCost
- HPA
- VPA
- Cluster Autoscaler
- Spot Nodes

Tagging:

Application
Owner
Environment
CostCenter

Generate cost dashboards.

